  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Behaviour change: numbers are formatted in the reader's own locale unless the new culture attribute pins one, instead of always tr-TR; every renderer string moves behind an overridable texts map. The field designer gains a packaged filter value picker (POST /pivotforge/field-values), state-storing and state-key for automatic save and restore, pointer-event dragging that works with touch and pen, and full keyboard operation. The rendered table now declares role=grid with the roles, aria-sort, aria-expanded and aria-rowcount that make its existing selection and keyboard model reach a screen reader; aria-label names it.",
